title: Security Event Log Cleared (1102)
id: da7d26ba-6c23-49fc-b443-0946e792ff95
status: experimental
description: Detects clearing of the Windows Security audit log (event 1102), an anti-forensics action that removes the record of authentication and privileged activity.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1070/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 1102
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Administrators clearing logs during maintenance
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1070.001
